{"name": "BLOODY HELL 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"63\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/1532a6c8b5d51ef748f5d26194167c3c.webp?t=1792420568\" width=\"620\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"164\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/49ffd27fbb63889ea8e45d9100af3ff8.poster.avif?t=1792420568\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/49ffd27fbb63889ea8e45d9100af3ff8.webm?t=1792420568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/49ffd27fbb63889ea8e45d9100af3ff8.mp4?t=1792420568\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Playing as a <strong>small angelic birb</strong>, you awaken from an eternity of slumber only to find <strong>heaven has fallen</strong> into the depths of hell. Time to pick up your <strong>giant demonic hammer</strong> and pulverize demons across the <strong>seven bizarre</strong> and <strong>twisted layers of hell</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover <strong>hidden upgrades</strong> and <strong>abilities</strong> to sate your hunger for power and find <strong>map fragments</strong> to chart your way through the inferno.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"93\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/6d612ac34dc2425b4c7d595d22b1e978.avif?t=1792420568\" width=\"620\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"164\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/f6345ed3a37444a979fff1e12975f727.poster.avif?t=1792420568\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/f6345ed3a37444a979fff1e12975f727.webm?t=1792420568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/f6345ed3a37444a979fff1e12975f727.mp4?t=1792420568\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Paint the walls red</strong> using demons as ammunition. <strong>Launch enemies</strong> into one another using your giant demonic hammer. Then <strong>consume their blood</strong> and use it as your own to unleash a devastating <strong>ultimate attack</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Restore power to your <strong>holy halo</strong> to demolish <strong>demonic bosses</strong> and other <strong>massive monstrosities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"93\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/f78f521a10c29012252c8bb8ca0a9a4c.avif?t=1792420568\" width=\"620\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"164\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/9e8d797796b76a580baa1650ac42b221.poster.avif?t=1792420568\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/9e8d797796b76a580baa1650ac42b221.webm?t=1792420568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/9e8d797796b76a580baa1650ac42b221.mp4?t=1792420568\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>God has disappeared</strong>, the sky has fallen, and angels are in distress. <strong>Strike deals with powers unknown</strong> and devour all who made heaven fall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover who is truly in charge of the world and <strong>lay bare the fabrics</strong> that are keeping it from falling apart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"93\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/6af36dc9541365d9965fe2ad5c875164.avif?t=1792420568\" width=\"620\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"164\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/729d5e28587a1bbe777965e23440fb1e.poster.avif?t=1792420568\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/729d5e28587a1bbe777965e23440fb1e.webm?t=1792420568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/729d5e28587a1bbe777965e23440fb1e.mp4?t=1792420568\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Pulverize demons as a small angelic birb wielding a giant demonic hammer. Explore hell's deepest layers, and uncover the truth behind the fall of heaven in this bullet-hell metroidvania. Will you succeed, or die in the chaotic depths of BLOODY HELL 2?", "heade